{
  "meta": {
    "package": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC_INT.pcc",
    "stem": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "textLang": "INT",
    "sets": 5
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80425",
      "en": "No offense, Commander, but what the hell were you thinking?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80426",
      "en": "You could've blown Jenna's cover.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80427",
      "en": "We were there to help her get out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80428",
      "en": "I gathered that. It might seem cold letting her take all the risk. But we're keeping a close eye on her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80429",
      "en": "This job isn't easy and it's usually unpleasant. I'll take help anywhere I can find it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80430",
      "en": "But since you're so concerned with her safety, maybe there's a way we can help each other.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80431",
      "en": "You C-Sec grunts are always trying to play the angles.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80432",
      "en": "It's part of the job. Now are you going to help me or not?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80433",
      "en": "I do have several contingencies; she's just my option \"A\".",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80434",
      "en": "Okay, maybe you're right. She's not really cut out for this, anyway.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80435",
      "en": "I'll cut her loose, even get her out of Chora's Den, no strings attached. But....",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80436",
      "en": "That still leaves my case unsolved. I could still use your help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80437",
      "en": "I'm trying to track down an illegal arms producer. I just need some of their product.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80438",
      "en": "Thanks to Jenna's intel, I've learned there's a seller here on the Citadel.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80439",
      "en": "Meet our man, named Jax, pick up the mods and bring them back here. That'll give me everything I need.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80440",
      "en": "Come on, Commander, we're on the same side here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80441",
      "en": "Fine. But Jenna stays right where she is until this case is solved.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80442",
      "en": "All right. I think we're done here, then. I'll have Jenna removed from Chora's Den, just like I said.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80447",
      "en": "I don't follow you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80450",
      "en": "It's too dangerous. You need to find another way.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80451",
      "en": "Do you really need to risk her life to get the information you want?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80452",
      "en": "But you're still using her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80456",
      "en": "You're a smart guy, Chellick. Figure out another way.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80458",
      "en": "Come on, Chellick. Do you really need a little human girl to help you solve your case?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80461",
      "en": "I'll help you, but I need some details.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80464",
      "en": "I'll persuade Jax to tell me where these mods are coming from.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80465",
      "en": "Where can I find this Jax?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80466",
      "en": "Why are you so concerned about these mods?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80467",
      "en": "This is just too much work.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80468",
      "en": "Sorry, Chellick, it's not going to happen.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80471",
      "en": "What makes them illegal?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80472",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80475",
      "en": "Sorry?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80478",
      "en": "Get her out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80479",
      "en": "Is it worth it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80480",
      "en": "I saw that.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80484",
      "en": "You don't need her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80485",
      "en": "Pathetic.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80486",
      "en": "All right. What do you need?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80487",
      "en": "Forget it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80493",
      "en": "I could just ask him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|80494",
      "en": "Sounds good.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81251",
      "en": "What do you suppose happens when we lose that edge?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81252",
      "en": "These give criminals an advantage we can't afford to let them keep.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81253",
      "en": "No. You tip Jax off and all my leads will disappear faster than you can say \"bad bust\".",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81254",
      "en": "Jax is down in the lower level of the markets. I'll send word through our channels that you're the buyer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81255",
      "en": "That's it? Just buy the weapons?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81256",
      "en": "That's it. Now, Jax will have his boys with him, but I don't want this turning into a firefight.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81257",
      "en": "Good luck, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81258",
      "en": "We have access to some of the most sophisticated weaponry there is. It's what gives us our edge.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81259",
      "en": "This'll be over quickly.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81260",
      "en": "I'll make sure that things don't get out of hand.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81269",
      "en": "I'll get going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81270",
      "en": "Don't worry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81273",
      "en": "I can talk to this Jax.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|81274",
      "en": "I see your point.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85048",
      "en": "What the hell happened down there, Commander?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85049",
      "en": "Commander. I hear you have something for me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85050",
      "en": "Excellent. This is everything I need. Hmm... maybe more than I need.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85051",
      "en": "As for Jenna, I'll make sure we get her out of Chora's Den immediately.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85052",
      "en": "I appreciate your help. It shows a lot of integrity. You didn't need to do anything after I let Jenna go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85054",
      "en": "Commander. Been to see Jax yet?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85055",
      "en": "Good. Don't keep Jax waiting too long.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85056",
      "en": "Jax needed killing. Here's your shipment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85057",
      "en": "Here's your shipment, Chellick.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85060",
      "en": "I'll get to it soon.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85061",
      "en": "Tell me again where I can find him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85062",
      "en": "I didn't like him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85064",
      "en": "Of course.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85067",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85068",
      "en": "Where's Jax?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|85069",
      "en": "Not yet.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88470",
      "en": "Damn it. I've got to get on this right away, before Jax's superiors get wind of his death.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88472",
      "en": "Jenna will be removed from harm's way.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88473",
      "en": "You've put me in a bit of bind here, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88474",
      "en": "Now, I need to the get these mods into evidence. Thanks again, Shepard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88475",
      "en": "See yourself out when you're ready.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88476",
      "en": "Quit your whining. Here's your shipment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88477",
      "en": "What about our deal?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88483",
      "en": "Shut up.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|88484",
      "en": "Get her out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|89481",
      "en": "Commander. I'm a little busy right now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|89482",
      "en": "Good to see you, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|89484",
      "en": "Not now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|89485",
      "en": "I'm busy, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|89486",
      "en": "Here, Commander, take this. I won't need it and you've earned some payment for your work.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|89499",
      "en": "What do you need?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101219",
      "en": "We were there to help her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101220",
      "en": "Always thinking ahead, Detective?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101221",
      "en": "Always playing the angles, Detective?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101222",
      "en": "Shrewd, Detective.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101223",
      "en": "Nice to see you're still working all the angles, Chellick.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101225",
      "en": "Just buy the weapons? That's it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101226",
      "en": "You just want us to buy the weapons? That's it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101227",
      "en": "Just buy the weapons? That's it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101228",
      "en": "So we just purchase these weapons?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101229",
      "en": "We were there to help her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101230",
      "en": "We were trying to help her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|101231",
      "en": "We were just getting information, Chellick.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104572",
      "en": "It's not that simple, Shepard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104573",
      "en": "Excuse me?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104574",
      "en": "Watch your tone, Chellick.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104576",
      "en": "Jenna first.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104577",
      "en": "Don't cross me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104578",
      "en": "Keeping tabs on me?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104579",
      "en": "What?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104580",
      "en": "Careful.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|104582",
      "en": "All right.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|124168",
      "en": "So long, Chellick.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|124169",
      "en": "Long shifts, short nights?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|124170",
      "en": "Work keeping you up at nights, Chellick?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|124173",
      "en": "Bye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|124174",
      "en": "Tough.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|124175",
      "en": "Sorry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|163995",
      "en": "Sorry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|172535",
      "en": "Forget it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|172536",
      "en": "Sure.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_chellik_D|172538",
      "en": "Alright.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|76291",
      "en": "Hey there-- oh. You're not C-Sec, are you? Did you want something?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|76292",
      "en": "I think I'll be going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|76293",
      "en": "What were you trying to explain to the officer before?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|76294",
      "en": "What are you doing here?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|76295",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|76296",
      "en": "I overheard you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|76297",
      "en": "Who are you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77842",
      "en": "Oh. All right then.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77843",
      "en": "I am Jahleed. I came here to seek aid from the authorities, but they won't listen to me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77844",
      "en": "My colleague is trying to kill me. And I thought we were friends.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77845",
      "en": "He's changed. He won't talk to me at work any more, and... he started following me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77846",
      "en": "Yesterday, he followed me all the way home. Just waiting for a chance.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77848",
      "en": "I don't care what anyone thinks; he wants me gone. I know it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77849",
      "en": "Would you? That's all I want: someone to talk to him. Tell him to leave me alone.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77851",
      "en": "He thinks he can just push me around, but you'll show him, won't you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77852",
      "en": "Oh, right. Well, he wanted to meet with me down in the wards, near the markets. He said he just wanted to talk, but I know better.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77853",
      "en": "His name's Chorban. He's a salarian. You shouldn't have any trouble. He's just a scientist.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77854",
      "en": "I've met some dangerous scientists in my time.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77855",
      "en": "Um, I suppose you're right. Well, good luck. Let me know what he says.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77856",
      "en": "All right. You're not the first one to say so. Goodbye, then.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77857",
      "en": "Oh, there you are. Have you spoken with Chorban yet?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77858",
      "en": "Oh, I think you'll find him down in the wards, near the markets. Good luck.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77860",
      "en": "How do you know he wants you dead?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77864",
      "en": "Is there something I can do? Talk to your friend, maybe?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77868",
      "en": "Just tell me where he is and I'll go find him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77872",
      "en": "I don't have time for this right now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77873",
      "en": "I haven't gone there yet.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77874",
      "en": "I'll get to it when I get to it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77875",
      "en": "Where is Chorban again?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77877",
      "en": "Kill you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77878",
      "en": "What do you need?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77879",
      "en": "Can't help you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77886",
      "en": "I'll talk to him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77890",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77891",
      "en": "Don't worry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77892",
      "en": "Directions.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77985",
      "en": "Of course, I'm sure you will deal with it appropriately. Good luck.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77986",
      "en": "Oh, it's you again. They still won't believe me, you know. Nobody believes me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77987",
      "en": "What won't anybody believe?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77988",
      "en": "I'll just be on my way.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77989",
      "en": "What do you want us to believe?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77990",
      "en": "What?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77991",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|77992",
      "en": "Really?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78074",
      "en": "But I can't. What will happen to the data when I'm gone? Who will carry on our research?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78075",
      "en": "You should've thought of that before you stole the data.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78076",
      "en": "But this data could be used to unravel all the secrets of the keepers! Think what we could learn about the Citadel!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78077",
      "en": "Well, it's still very preliminary. But our initial scans suggest the keepers are as old as the Citadel itself. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78079",
      "en": "We might learn how the Citadel was built. Or why the keepers always rearrange things. The possibilities are limitless!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78080",
      "en": "I suppose I should. All right, I'll take it back and continue work on it there.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78081",
      "en": "No, please. I'll do anything. I've got credits. Let me go and you can have them, all of them.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78082",
      "en": "What's going on over here? Is this volus causing you some trouble, Commander?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78083",
      "en": "Really? I think you'd better come with me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78084",
      "en": "But....",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78085",
      "en": "I'll take it from here, Commander. Thanks for your help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78086",
      "en": "But the data! You don't know what you've done!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78087",
      "en": "All right, save it for your lawyer.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78088",
      "en": "If you say so. I'll be right over here if you change your mind.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78089",
      "en": "Thank you. That was too close.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78090",
      "en": "Oh, right. There you go. That's just about everything I've got.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78091",
      "en": "All right, I will. I'll take it back to work and continue developing it there.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78092",
      "en": "Thank you for not turning me in. I'll make the most of this second chance, I promise you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78093",
      "en": "Um... Commander? Would you be interested in helping me study the keepers?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78094",
      "en": "Hello again. Did you have any luck finding Chorban?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78095",
      "en": "But I didn't do anything to you!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78096",
      "en": "Lying? Why would I lie to you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78097",
      "en": "What about the keeper data? We know about that.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78098",
      "en": "Uh, he told you? I didn't mean for any of this to happen.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78099",
      "en": "I was afraid Chorban would kill me to get the data, so I... well, I was hoping you'd take care of him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78102",
      "en": "This is serious, Jahleed. You could spend the rest of your life locked up.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78103",
      "en": "I can't let this continue any further. I'm reporting what you did.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78106",
      "en": "Tell me more about this data.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78109",
      "en": "If it's that important, then take it back to the people it belongs to.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78110",
      "en": "I can't let your actions go unpunished.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78112",
      "en": "He's admitted to stealing data from his workplace.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78117",
      "en": "Everything's okay, Officer. Thanks for asking.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78119",
      "en": "Now you can return the favor by filling up my bank account.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78121",
      "en": "Return the data or I'll have you arrested, right here, right now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78123",
      "en": "Have a nice day, Jahleed.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78124",
      "en": "Just go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78125",
      "en": "I killed him, and I've come back for you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78126",
      "en": "I found out you've been lying to me, Jahleed.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78129",
      "en": "He's dead.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78130",
      "en": "Yes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78134",
      "en": "You're in trouble.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78135",
      "en": "You idiot!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78136",
      "en": "I'm turning you in.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78139",
      "en": "Go on.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78140",
      "en": "Explain.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78143",
      "en": "Then do it legally.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78144",
      "en": "Too bad.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78145",
      "en": "Take it back!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78147",
      "en": "Yes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78148",
      "en": "We're fine.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78154",
      "en": "Payment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78157",
      "en": "Fine.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78158",
      "en": "Whatever.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|78159",
      "en": "Good.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90224",
      "en": "Oh, it's you. Did you change your mind? Do you have time to help me now?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90225",
      "en": "I just want someone to talk to my colleague. He's been acting strange and I think he wants to kill me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90226",
      "en": "What did you need?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90227",
      "en": "No thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90228",
      "en": "How can I help?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90229",
      "en": "Sure.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90379",
      "en": "This is not good.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90380",
      "en": "Why won't anyone believe me?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|90381",
      "en": "I'm not leaving until somebody looks into this.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101258",
      "en": "Some scientists can be very dangerous.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101259",
      "en": "Well, good luck.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101260",
      "en": "What about the keeper data?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101261",
      "en": "You forgot to mention the data about the keeper.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101262",
      "en": "What about the data? You did not mentioned that before.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101263",
      "en": "You lied to us about the keeper data.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101264",
      "en": "It's a bit late to be thinking about that.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101265",
      "en": "Too late, volus. You had your chance.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101266",
      "en": "You should've thought of that sooner.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101267",
      "en": "It's a shame, but you should have considered the consequences before you acted.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101287",
      "en": "I don't care.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|101288",
      "en": "Yes. I'll help you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121585",
      "en": "Well, I thought I'd ask. So long.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121586",
      "en": "Just take this scanner. Every time you see a keeper, scan it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121587",
      "en": "Whenever you get a unique scan I'll reimburse you. That's it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121588",
      "en": "Good luck, and so long.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121589",
      "en": "I don't have time for this.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121590",
      "en": "What do you need me to do?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121593",
      "en": "Sounds interesting.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121594",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|121595",
      "en": "Sure.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145282",
      "en": "You're... you're helping us? But... well, if you say so.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145283",
      "en": "Well, if Chorban can forgive and forget, then so can I.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145284",
      "en": "I appreciate the help, Commander. I better go get that data analyzed.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145287",
      "en": "Chorban? That's the guy who asked us to scan the keepers.",
