    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145288",
      "en": "Chorban? That's the guy who asked us to scan the keepers.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145289",
      "en": "Chorban? Isn't that the salarian who asked us to scan the keepers?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145290",
      "en": "Chorban? Wasn't that the salarian who asked us to scan the keepers?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145291",
      "en": "Chorban? That's the guy who wanted us to scan the keepers.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145292",
      "en": "The keepers? Well... even more reason to go after him. That's against regulations.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145293",
      "en": "Anything's possible with Chorban these days.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145296",
      "en": "I'm scanning the keepers for Chorban. But you two need to stop fighting.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145301",
      "en": "I'd better look into this right away. Find out what he's up to.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145302",
      "en": "If I find out he's lied to me....",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145306",
      "en": "It's okay.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145307",
      "en": "We're in this together.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145308",
      "en": "Relax. I'm helping out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145312",
      "en": "How can I help?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145315",
      "en": "Good point.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145316",
      "en": "Bastard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|145317",
      "en": "I see.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|153967",
      "en": "Not now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|153968",
      "en": "Leave it to me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|153969",
      "en": "That's a serious claim.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|163996",
      "en": "Definitely.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|165476",
      "en": "He didn't make it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|165477",
      "en": "I'm afraid so.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|165478",
      "en": "Of course.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|165479",
      "en": "You idiot!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_jahleed_D|171633",
      "en": "You idiot!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_officer_01_D|77271",
      "en": "Hello, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_officer_01_D|89788",
      "en": "Can't help you right now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_officer_01_D|89789",
      "en": "Sorry, Commander. I'm just waiting for a report from my supervisor.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_officer_01_D|146205",
      "en": "Been to Flux's yet?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|75830",
      "en": "Okay, Jahleed. Let me get this straight. Your business partner... Chorban. He's threatened you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|75831",
      "en": "Well, no, not exactly. But he wants to meet with me. I think he's going to kill me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|75832",
      "en": "And why do you think that?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|75833",
      "en": "I-- I can't really get into the details. But Chorban will kill me if I leave here unprotected.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|75834",
      "en": "I can't help you. Not unless you give me something more to go on.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|75835",
      "en": "I-- I can't. I'm sorry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|75836",
      "en": "Then I've got other work to do.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|113720",
      "en": "But--",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_01_jahleedfears_D|113721",
      "en": "But nothing! Don't bother me unless you're willing to give me details.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA30_04A_DSG_LOC|sta30_trig_here2see_chellick_D|88493",
      "en": "Detective Chellick. Come into my office. I want to discuss this in private.",
      "tr": ""
    }
